# Example secret contract for the api-gateway deployment (SPEC-008 R-3/R-7).
# Copy to runtime-secrets.env (never committed) and replace the placeholder, or
# let CI inject the real value. Sync into the cluster as the optional Secret
# 'api-gateway-runtime-secrets' referenced by the gateway deployment.
#
# The value must match the client secret registered on the identity-broker
# (IDENTITY_SERVICE_CLIENTS). It confers no user authority on its own; it only
# authorizes the token-exchange operation.
GATEWAY_SERVICE_CLIENT_SECRET=replace-with-gateway-service-client-secret
